šÍi<?php exit; ?>a:2:{s:7:"content";O:8:"stdClass":24:{s:2:"ID";i:5360;s:11:"post_author";s:1:"1";s:9:"post_date";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:02";s:13:"post_date_gmt";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:02";s:12:"post_content";s:993:"<p>Accessibility as default means designers specify focus order and engineers test keyboard paths in CI, not a checkbox the week before launch.</p><blockquote class="blog-details__blockquote"><p>Observability is not more logsâ€”it is tying user journeys to service graphs so on-call stops playing telephone.</p></blockquote><p>NSC bakes axe checks, contrast tokens, and screen reader spot checks into definitions of done for customer-facing surfaces.</p><h2 class="blog-details__h2">Closing notes</h2><p>Legal risk matters, but the moral case is simpler: excluding users excludes revenue and talent.</p><hr class="blog-details__divider" /><ol class="blog-details__list"><li>Hire reviewers with lived experience</li><li>Never ship custom controls without tests</li><li>Train support on assistive tech basics</li></ol><ul class="blog-details__list"><li>Hire reviewers with lived experience</li><li>Never ship custom controls without tests</li><li>Train support on assistive tech basics</li></ul>";s:10:"post_title";s:41:"Accessibility as a Default, Not an Add-on";s:12:"post_excerpt";s:265:"Accessibility as a Default, Not an Add-on â€” Accessibility as default means designers specify focus order and engineers test keyboard paths in CI, not a checkbox the week before launch. Legal risk matters, but the moral case is simpler: excluding users excludesâ€¦";s:11:"post_status";s:7:"publish";s:14:"comment_status";s:4:"open";s:11:"ping_status";s:4:"open";s:13:"post_password";s:0:"";s:9:"post_name";s:40:"accessibility-as-a-default-not-an-add-on";s:7:"to_ping";s:0:"";s:6:"pinged";s:0:"";s:13:"post_modified";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:02";s:17:"post_modified_gmt";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:02";s:21:"post_content_filtered";s:0:"";s:11:"post_parent";i:0;s:4:"guid";s:58:"https://nsc.test/acces